# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# The Deskbar preferences carry the text size: two clicks and the whole
# interface reads bigger, proven by the leaf menu growing taller.
wait 12
click 980 20
wait 2
note at 12 px the leaf menu ends at 290, above the point below
expect-pixel 850 304 336698
menu-pick Settings
wait 3
menu-pick Deskbar preferences
wait 5
click 668 270
wait 3
key w ctrl
wait 3
click 980 20
wait 3
note at 14 px the same rows reach past it: the menu ran to 290,
note and now runs to 316 -- taller rows, the same number of them
expect-pixel 850 304 d8d8d8
quit
